WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.464 --> 00:00:02.585
(music)

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.585
(music)

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.160
- Vaccine passes being
mandatory were being

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.260
debated in the US and
other Western countries

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.640
even before the first COVID-19
vaccines were available.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.300
Here in Italy, the
government has introduced

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.950
one of the toughest in the west,

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:19.340
requiring all workers to prove
they have been vaccinated,

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.010
have tested negative in
the previous 48 hours,

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.712
or have recently recovered from COVID-19.

00:00:24.712 --> 00:00:27.462
(crowd cheering)

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.210
While most Italians are in favor

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.460
of requiring the green
pass to be able to work,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.793
implementation hasn't
been without pushback.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.830
People here in Milan
and other parts of Italy

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.473
have been protesting against
the green pass mandate.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.186
(crowd protesting)

00:00:42.186 --> 00:00:43.640
The day after the implementation,

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.720
some 15,000 protesters took
to the streets here in Milan

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.750
with some violence included.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.940
A small but growing resistance
to the past in Italy,

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.350
gives an idea of what the
Biden administration could

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:55.860
be up against as it
gets ready to introduce

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.960
its own vaccine mandate.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.080
- Labor department is gonna
soon be issuing an emergency

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.800
rule for companies with a
hundred or more employees

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.463
to implement vaccination
requirements among their workforce.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:17.860
- The COVID-19 health pass,

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.020
which is known as the
green pass here in Italy,

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.910
includes an individual
QR code for each person.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.500
It can be shown on a printed page

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.850
or somebody's mobile phone.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.520
Italy has required the green
pass since early August

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.860
for indoor activities
like going to restaurants,

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.570
bars, museums, and theaters.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.950
So people have had time to get used to it,

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:45.977
but the workplace requirement
has sparked a heated debate.

